# Raw personal HDYC (hdyc.neis-one.org) exports used to generate
# artifacts/osm-leaderboard/public/hdyc-corrections.json. The .html snapshots
# themselves ARE tracked (published for transparency — every number in
# hdyc-corrections.json is traceable to one of these saved pages). Only the
# accompanying _files/ dumps stay ignored: each "Save Page As" also mirrors
# that page's vendor assets (Leaflet, Chart.js, CSS, icons — ~0.5-1MB per
# user, no data value, same handful of library files duplicated per user).
# See scripts/src/extract-hdyc-corrections.ts.
/HDCY2OSMlogs/*_files/
